opaque black satin off-shoulder midi dress and black low-heeled shoes.\n<Subject 2> is the apartment window, soft city lights and warm interior lighting in <Picture 1>.\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A ten-second live-action evening fashion portrait. <Subject 1> turns from the city view, walks a little closer to the viewer and settles into confident eye contact with a warm, understated smile. The appeal comes from elegant styling, expression and light.\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Preserve the same adult identity, hairstyle, dress and shoes. The picture provides appearance and wardrobe reference rather than a compulsory first frame. Keep the original garment coverage throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Preserve the room geometry, window, evening city background, warm practical light and soft facial fill.\ndetailed_description:\nNaturalistic cinematic fashion photography, balanced warm skin tones, readable facial detail and a softly layered background.\n[Shot 1] One uninterrupted eye-level full-body shot keeps the complete bun, hands, dress hem and both shoes within the frame throughout the ten seconds. Begin with <Subject 1> standing beside the window, her body angled gently toward the city view and her face in a soft three-quarter profile. The camera remains steady at conversational eye level, with clear floor space in front of her. Warm light skims the satin while a soft reflected fill keeps the eyes readable.\nFor the first two seconds, she finishes looking out of the window, then turns her eyes, head and shoulders toward the viewer in that order. Her posture remains relaxed; the small turn is grounded in a comfortable shift of weight rather than an isolated twist of the neck. A restrained smile begins at the corners of her mouth as she recognizes the camera.\nFrom roughly two to five seconds, she takes two unhurried steps toward the viewer. Each heel touches the floor naturally before the weight settles, and the satin hem follows with a small delayed sway. Her hands remain relaxed by her sides and her shoulders stay level. Keep both shoes and their floor contact clearly visible, and keep the dress opaque with its neckline and hem stable.\nDuring the next two seconds, she comes to a comfortable stop, lets her weight settle onto one leg and turns her shoulders slightly to create a relaxed three-quarter fashion pose. The movement eases gently to rest. The dress forms believable folds around the changed stance instead of stretching independently of her body. Her individual facial proportions stay consistent as she comes nearer.\nThrough the final three seconds, she meets the lens directly. Her expression becomes a little warmer and more self-assured, with a subtle change in her cheeks and eye corners, then softens with a quiet natural breath. Keep the response understated and alive rather than holding a rigid smile. She neither changes clothing nor adds a new action at the end. Maintain full-body framing, continuous light and stable room geometry, with no cuts, mirror duplicates or captions.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet apartment room tone with very distant, muted city ambience. Two gentle heel contacts and a faint satin rustle follow the visible walking and settling movements. Keep the sound natural and unobtrusive. No spoken dialogue, narration or additional voices.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A", "match", 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 6, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 4, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 5, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 1, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "